OL,3,GNEWSA'It started with a cup of tea -
OL,4,Anow we help thousands'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Victoria Armstrong moved to
OL,7,FManchester as a university student in
OL,8,Fthe 1990s she started to notice there
OL,9,Fwere people living in her community who
OL,10,F"had no-one".
OL,12,FSo she decided she wanted to help.
OL,14,F"I spent the first six months just
OL,15,Fputting on a kettle and putting bread
OL,16,Fin the toaster," the 53-year-old said.
